		<Description>The commercial invoice has changed or items (i.e. lines) were missed in the original submission. This change may result in more or fewer Entry Summary Line Item Groupings. For an EIP summary the change may affect the EIP Invoice Grouping (i.e. the Invoice Line Reference Detail).</Description>
